      <h2>
        Engineering limitations
      </h2>

      <p>
        The project highlighted several differences between robotic machining
        and conventional CNC machining.
      </p>

      <ul>
        <li>
          Lower structural stiffness
        </li>

        <li>
          Greater sensitivity to cutting forces
        </li>

        <li>
          Configuration-dependent rigidity
        </li>

        <li>
          More complex kinematics
        </li>

        <li>
          Need for careful toolpath planning
        </li>

        <li>
          Potential vibration and accuracy limitations
        </li>
      </ul>

    </div>

  </section>


