    <div class="detail-copy">

      <h2>
        What I learned
      </h2>

      <p>
        Robot Milling showed me how different robotic machining is from simply
        mounting a spindle on an industrial robot.
      </p>

      <p>
        Successful machining depends on the interaction between cutting conditions,
        robot stiffness, tool orientation, kinematics and geometric accuracy.
      </p>

      <p>
        The project also introduced me to the direct link between mathematical
        surface representation, geometric reconstruction and physical manufacturing.
      </p>

